    "text": "IV. Santa Fe to Pay Lincoln General $1.5 Million Santa Fe shall pay Lincoln General $1.5 million. It shall pay this ainount in 5 equal payments of $300,000 starting on January 2, 2010 and continuing with $300,000 payments each following Jatuary 2 until all $1.5 million is paid. Santa Fe shall make a promissory note payable to Lincoln General to memorialize this obligation (in a form, substantially similar to Bxhibit A)."
