    "name": "Section VI — Tolling",
    "text": "VI. Tolling The Parties agree to toll the running of the statute of limitations as to all causes of action at issue in the above Lawsuit or otherwise related to the 2002 GAA, 2002 QIS, 2003 GAA, 2003 QS, and all addenda to those agreoments, for five (5) years of until all claims on policies subject to those agresments have been paid and sctiled bétween the. Parties pursuant to any and all agreements between them (including this Memozandum of Understanding and any agreements MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING Page 3 85/67/2009 17:14 9722398512 PAGE 94/85 ee 2 ee ee oe ed * eee a PSs . tte et ote we at nla tdedmmend 7 eG ers Pa atte tats ght on tyes Is Be SA OGRE aE a . * Pe . se enim ted a eT a Uh: entered into sabsequent to this Memorandum of Understanding). It is intended that this tolling agreement shall extend to, but not be limited to, Lincoln General’s “Other Causes of Action” detailed in the April 28, 2008 letter agreement between Lincoln General, U.S, Auto, Gamma, CSi, Alpha, and Doug Maxwell, It is further intended thet this tolling agreement extends to any defenses, counterclaims, or equitable theories U.S. Auto or other Defendants axe asserting in the Lawsuit at the time of its dismissal without prejudice. All claims, defenses, counterclaims, or equitable feories will have the same limitations posture as they had in the lawsuit prior to its ismissal."
